From: Folia Compatibility Patch
Subject: [PATCH 0025] MinecraftVersion: Fix version parsing and remove lombok

AE PATCH REASON: Minecraft version parsing fails on some server versions (Paper/Folia) where NMS package name format differs. @Generated lombok annotations add unnecessary noise.
AE PATCH FIX: Replace fallback version parsing with regex-based extraction of MC version from Bukkit.getVersion() string. Add fallback to MC1_21_R7 for unknown versions with informative log message. Remove @Generated annotations from accessor methods.
AE PATCH RISK: LOW

